## 待审文本（按字段）
{
 "reply": "Hi there,\n\nThank you for your inquiry about our 4.5L Digital Air Fryer (model AF-45D). Here are clear answers to each of your questions.\n\n1. Certifications\nWe do not currently hold ETL or an FCC SDoC test report for this model. Its current certifications are:\n- CB report (IEC 60335-2-9)\n- CE (LVD/EMC)\n\nThe CB report is a good basis for ETL testing. If you would like to go ahead, we can check the testing cost and timeline with a lab and come back to you. Please note that testing would add time and cost before shipment.\n\n2. Basket coating\nThe standard basket uses a PTFE non-stick coating, so it is not PTFE-free. For PFOA, we only have a declaration from our coating supplier, not a third-party test report. We are checking with our suppliers whether a PTFE-free basket option is possible, and we will share the details and price impact once confirmed.\n\n3. Quantity and price\nOur MOQ is 1,000 units. Our prices, FOB Ningbo-Zhoushan, are:\n- 1,000–2,999 units: USD 24.5/unit\n- 3,000+ units: USD 22.8/unit\n\nWe understand your target is USD 20. However, USD 22.8 at 3,000+ units is the best price we can offer for this model.\n\nThe price covers the US version: 120V 60Hz, 1400W, with 8 presets, a digital touch panel, a 60-minute timer and a dishwasher-safe basket. Packing is one color box per unit and 2 units per carton.\n\n4. Lead time\nOur standard lead time is 35 days after deposit, so we cannot promise shipment within 30 days. If ETL/FCC testing is needed, the lead time will be longer. We will confirm the exact schedule together with the testing plan.\n\nPayment terms\n- 30% T/T deposit, 70% against B/L copy, or\n- L/C at sight\n\nNext steps\n- Samples: Samples are charged at the ex-factory unit price, and international freight is paid by the buyer. The sample cost can be deducted from your bulk order.\n- Video factory audit: We can arrange one through an Alibaba video call.\n- Logo printing: We print your logo on the color box free of charge for 1,000 pcs or more. Please provide your artwork in vector format.\n\nCould you let me know two things?\n1. Would you consider 1,000 units?\n2. Should we check the ETL/FCC testing cost and timeline for you?\n\nI will follow up with the details as soon as possible.\n\nBest regards,\nSales Team\nYongjiang Small Appliances"
}
